on the wing, and it's

1284
00:47:00,470 --> 00:47:02,500
doing that by deflecting
the leading edge flaps.

1285
00:47:02,500 --> 00:47:05,000
So that flight control surface
display I showed you earlier,

1286
00:47:05,000 --> 00:47:07,520
the horizontal stabilators
would be completely streamlined.

1287
00:47:07,520 --> 00:47:10,790
And all of the maneuvering is
coming from the wing itself,

1288
00:47:10,790 --> 00:47:12,570
which is pretty amazing.

1289
