00:47:49,820 --> 00:47:51,200
We need somebody better here.

1305
00:47:51,200 --> 00:47:52,460
RANDY GORDON: I know, totally.

1306
00:47:52,460 --> 00:47:55,380
[LAUGHTER]

1307
00:47:58,320 --> 00:48:01,090
So at that speed, again,
it's the g command system.

1308
00:48:01,090 --> 00:48:02,950
The pilot is commanding
a certain g rate.

1309
00:48:02,950 --> 00:48:05,600
And miner deflections are
happening all the way here back

1310
00:48:05,600 --> 00:48:07,100
along the back edge
of the airplane.

1311
00:48:07,100 --> 00:48:09,040
The pilot has no input on that.

1312
00:48:09,040 --> 00:48:11,700
The system is doing everything
possible to command that g

1313
00:48:11,700 --> 00:48:12,910
