1314
00:48:15,370 --> 00:48:16,830
You'll see one
other maneuver here.

1315
00:48:16,830 --> 00:48:19,640
Pause for a second.

1316
00:48:19,640 --> 00:48:21,700
So what this maneuver is is--

1317
00:48:21,700 --> 00:48:24,610
and again, slow speed.

1318
00:48:24,610 --> 00:48:27,400
Airplane's going straight up,
and what they're trying to do

1319
00:48:27,400 --> 00:48:30,070
is basically pitch
forward completely and get

1320
00:48:30,070 --> 00:48:32,320
the airplane-- so it's almost
like you're flying an L,

1321
00:48:32,320 --> 00:48:34,040
like you're going
straight up and then you

1322
00:48:34,040 --> 00:48:35,910
