1328
00:48:45,010 --> 00:48:46,660
Watch what happens
to all the flight

1329
00:48:46,660 --> 00:48:48,450
controls in the
back of the airplane

1330
00:48:48,450 --> 00:48:50,830
to keep that airplane going
exactly where the pilot wants

1331
00:48:50,830 --> 00:48:51,160
it to.

1332
00:48:51,160 --> 00:48:51,660
Play.

1333
00:48:54,850 --> 00:48:56,470
So you'll see huge
deflections out

1334
00:48:56,470 --> 00:48:58,120
