1347
00:49:37,910 --> 00:49:41,270
It's a little bit fluid when
it comes to a Raptor's stuff.

1348
00:49:41,270 --> 00:49:42,320
Stuff happens back there.

1349
00:49:42,320 --> 00:49:43,280
PROFESSOR: Touch and go video?

